    "detailed_description": "Art Gallery Simulator is a business building simulation game where you get to run art galleries! You start with a run down art gallery in the slums of the city, and eventually work your way up to owning a full blown art museum!<br><br>Built upon the Unreal Engine 5 framework, Art Gallery Simulator has very good graphics and a gameplay loop that will keep you occupied for days. If you like Simulation games, or the simulation genre in general then Art Gallery Simulator is a game you absolutely must play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN YOUR BUSINESS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/b0769a55e4e4be15a46d03048dbdc4c7.poster.avif?t=1731035286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/b0769a55e4e4be15a46d03048dbdc4c7.webm?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/b0769a55e4e4be15a46d03048dbdc4c7.mp4?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build your business from the ground up. Buy and sell art pieces, from paintings, to statues, to decorations. Increase the appeal of your store and get rich while watching customers flock to your art gallery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE CITY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f4ab0b613704e902af8e193f496140dc.poster.avif?t=1731035286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f4ab0b613704e902af8e193f496140dc.webm?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f4ab0b613704e902af8e193f496140dc.mp4?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore three different sections of the city. Start your business from the ground up in the run down slums. Once you've found success, consider buying an art gallery in the middle class district. Don't stop there! Push the limits after buying a full blown art museum in the downtown commercial district.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND AND ORGANIZE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f05864714f08bbcb550bd01a931de0f7.poster.avif?t=1731035286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f05864714f08bbcb550bd01a931de0f7.webm?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f05864714f08bbcb550bd01a931de0f7.mp4?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With hundreds of art pieces to choose from, buy up art and put it on display. Use your hard earned cash to buy more display shelves, bigger picture frames for larger paintings, and more! Upgrading your store is critical to your success.",
    "about_the_game": "Art Gallery Simulator is a business building simulation game where you get to run art galleries! You start with a run down art gallery in the slums of the city, and eventually work your way up to owning a full blown art museum!<br><br>Built upon the Unreal Engine 5 framework, Art Gallery Simulator has very good graphics and a gameplay loop that will keep you occupied for days. If you like Simulation games, or the simulation genre in general then Art Gallery Simulator is a game you absolutely must play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN YOUR BUSINESS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/b0769a55e4e4be15a46d03048dbdc4c7.poster.avif?t=1731035286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/b0769a55e4e4be15a46d03048dbdc4c7.webm?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/b0769a55e4e4be15a46d03048dbdc4c7.mp4?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build your business from the ground up. Buy and sell art pieces, from paintings, to statues, to decorations. Increase the appeal of your store and get rich while watching customers flock to your art gallery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE CITY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f4ab0b613704e902af8e193f496140dc.poster.avif?t=1731035286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f4ab0b613704e902af8e193f496140dc.webm?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f4ab0b613704e902af8e193f496140dc.mp4?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore three different sections of the city. Start your business from the ground up in the run down slums. Once you've found success, consider buying an art gallery in the middle class district. Don't stop there! Push the limits after buying a full blown art museum in the downtown commercial district.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND AND ORGANIZE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f05864714f08bbcb550bd01a931de0f7.poster.avif?t=1731035286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f05864714f08bbcb550bd01a931de0f7.webm?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300620/extras/f05864714f08bbcb550bd01a931de0f7.mp4?t=1731035286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With hundreds of art pieces to choose from, buy up art and put it on display. Use your hard earned cash to buy more display shelves, bigger picture frames for larger paintings, and more! Upgrading your store is critical to your success.",
    "short_description": "Enjoy a side of art with a serving of business building! Go rags to riches! Start by fixing up an art gallery in the slums and work your way up in the world. Sell thousands of unique pieces of art and eventually open up your very own art museum in the high class downtown commercial district!",
